  chapterName: Gawigawen
  chapterDescription: A massive, six-headed giant wielding a huge spear. Though fierce,
    this mountain guardian honors brave travelers, clearing safe paths for them with
    a burst of booming laughter.
  chapterUnlocked: 0
  storyUnlocked: 0
  killsNeededToUnlockName: 1
  killsNeededToUnlockImage: 1
  killsNeededToUnlockDesc: 1
  shortStory: "Lost deep in the mountains of Luzon, Tomas froze as the ground began
    to tremble.\r\n\r\nStepping through the thick canopy came Gawigawen, the giant
    of Isneg legend. All six of his heads turned in unison, twelve dark eyes locking
    onto the tiny human as he raised a colossal spear.\r\n\r\nInstead of striking,
    all six heads burst into a booming laugh that shook the trees\u2014the giant
    was amused by the traveler who stood his ground.\r\n\r\nWith one swift sweep
    of his massive spear, Gawigawen sliced through the thick jungle vines, clearing
    a sunlit path straight down toward the lowland villages.\r\n\r\nTomas gave a
    quick, respectful bow and sprinted down the trail, the thunderous, six-voiced
    laughter of the giant echoing behind him all the way home.\r"
